OL,3,AFour dead after powerful Typhoon Dujuan
OL,4,Alashes Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have died in Japan after
OL,7,FTyphoon Dujuan battered Tokyo and
OL,8,Fsurrounding prefectures with torrential
OL,9,Frains and destructive winds, local
OL,10,Freports said.
OL,12,FThe storm cut power for 50,000 people
OL,13,Fand caused the suspension of hundreds
OL,14,Fof flights. Most evacuation orders were
OL,15,Flifted on Tueday as the storm pulled
OL,16,Faway from Japan's eastern coast.
OL,18,FAt the height of the storm on Monday,
OL,19,Fauthorities warned of an "imminent
OL,20,Fthreat to life" and urged 1.9 million
OL,21,Fpeople to move to shelters.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
