OL,3,AFour dead after powerful Typhoon Dujuan
OL,4,Alashes Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fatalities were from landslides in
OL,7,FKanagawa and Chiba prefectures. Six
OL,8,Fothers were reported missing, public
OL,9,Fbroadcaster NHK reported.
